      "text": "Step 1: Sort each string to get key\n  eat -> aet, tea -> aet, tan -> ant\n  ate -> aet, nat -> ant, bat -> abt\n\nStep 2: Map sorted key to group\n  Map: {\n    'aet' -> ['eat', 'tea', 'ate'],\n    'ant' -> ['tan', 'nat'],\n    'abt' -> ['bat']\n  }",
